sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant BC as BookingController
  participant BS as BookingService
  participant DB as H2
  C->>BC: POST /api/v1/bookings
  BC->>BC: Bean Validation (400 on failure)
  BC->>BS: create(request)
  Note over BS,DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
  BS->>DB: SELECT flight_instance ... FOR UPDATE
  Note right of DB: other bookers of this flight wait here
  BS->>BS: validate window, departure, seats exist, no duplicates
  BS->>DB: SELECT active seats of flight
  alt any requested seat taken
    BS-->>C: 409 Conflict (rollback)
  else all free
    BS->>DB: INSERT booking + booking_seat rows
    Note over DB: UNIQUE(flight_instance_id, active_seat_label) final guard
    BS-->>C: 201 Created (commit, lock released)
  end
